We have 3 tape drives on a 6410 and we are worried that users
will inadvertantly mount and write over another user's tape
already in the tape device.  We realize that the MOUNT command
automatically allocates the device but the DISMOUNT/NOUNLOAD
also deallocates that device.  As the tape drives and the tapes
themselves are handled not by our users but by our operators in
a separately enclosed room, you can see that a user may not be 
